    {
      "id": "1024396",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Travel Time:\r\nRiders using the shuttle buses should budget extra travel time. For example, a rider traveling to South Station from Worcester should budget approximately 20 extra minutes of travel in addition to their regular trip time. \r\n\r\nAffected Stations:\r\nWorcester\r\nGrafton\r\n\r\nShuttle Stop Locations:\r\nWorcester Union Station Bus Terminal (Bays #1-3)\r\nGrafton Station Parking Lot \r\n\r\nAccessibility Information:\r\nAll shuttle buses are equipped with a wheelchair lift, and all shuttle stops are accessible.",
      "severity": 8,
